<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Privacy manifest of the Runner app target. Plugins and SDKs ship their own
  (geolocator_apple, shared_preferences, path_provider, permission_handler,
  flutter_secure_storage, url_launcher, image_picker, package_info_plus,
  file_picker, firebase_messaging, flutter_local_notifications, Firebase,
  Sentry); this file covers only the app's own code and the data the app
  collects. Keep it in sync with store/appstore/app-privacy.md.

  Required-reason APIs used by the app's own code:
  - UserDefaults (ios/Runner/WorkdayLocation.swift keeps the open work day's
    capture state in the app's own defaults): CA92.1.
-->
